{
  "data": [
    {
      "function": {
        "description": "查看业务表的字段、允许的关联和允许的筛选值。不查询任何数据。\n何时用：写 SQL 前还不知道某张表的字段或筛选值时。\n何时不用：提示里已列出该表字段时，不要重复查看。\n示例参数：{\"tables\": [\"sales_orders\", \"customers\"]}\n常见错误：表名不在可用表列表中",
        "name": "describe_table",
        "parameters": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "tables": {
              "description": "要查看的表名",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "maxItems": 4,
              "minItems": 1,
              "title": "Tables",
              "type": "array"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "tables"
          ],
          "title": "DescribeTableArgs",
          "type": "object"
        }
      },
      "type": "function"
    },
    {
      "function": {
        "description": "提交一条只读 SELECT 查询。代码会先校验再执行，公司范围由系统决定。\n何时用：已知道所需的表和字段，可以回答问题时。\n何时不用：资料类问题，或可用表确实没有所需数据时。\n示例参数：{\"sql\": \"SELECT SUM(o.total_amount) AS \\\"销售额\\\" FROM sales_orders o\", \"purpose\": \"统计销售额\", \"query_contract\": {\"required_concepts\": [\"销售额\"], \"expected_columns\": [\"销售额\"], \"result_kind\": \"aggregate\", \"empty_result_policy\": \"no_matching_records\", \"metric_definition_ref\": \"<上面列出的指标引用>\", \"time_scope_column\": \"sales_orders.order_date\"}}\n常见错误：日期写成 '2025-08'，应写完整日期；用了未列出的字段；结果列没有用中文别名；没有满足指标的固定筛选",
        "name": "run_sql",
        "parameters": {
          "$defs": {
            "NumericAssertion": {
              "description": "A bounded, machine-checkable numeric statement about one query result.",
              "properties": {
                "column": {
                  "maxLength": 160,
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "title": "Column",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "operator": {
                  "enum": [
                    "equals",
                    "greater_than",
                    "less_than"
                  ],
                  "title": "Operator",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "value": {
                  "anyOf": [
                    {
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  ],
                  "title": "Value"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "column",
                "operator",
                "value"
              ],
              "title": "NumericAssertion",
              "type": "object"
            },
            "QueryContract": {
              "description": "What one candidate query must return before it may become business evidence.",
              "properties": {
                "empty_result_policy": {
                  "const": "no_matching_records",
                  "default": "no_matching_records",
                  "title": "Empty Result Policy",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "expected_columns": {
                  "items": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "maxItems": 12,
                  "minItems": 1,
                  "title": "Expected Columns",
                  "type": "array"
                },
                "metric_definition_ref": {
                  "anyOf": [
                    {
                      "maxLength": 80,
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "null"
                    }
                  ],
                  "default": null,
                  "title": "Metric Definition Ref"
                },
                "numeric_assertion": {
                  "anyOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/$defs/NumericAssertion"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "null"
                    }
                  ],
                  "default": null
                },
                "required_concepts": {
                  "items": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "maxItems": 8,
                  "minItems": 1,
                  "title": "Required Concepts",
                  "type": "array"
                },
                "result_kind": {
                  "enum": [
                    "aggregate",
                    "records",
                    "comparison"
                  ],
                  "title": "Result Kind",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "time_scope_column": {
                  "anyOf": [
                    {
                      "maxLength": 160,
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "null"
                    }
                  ],
                  "default": null,
                  "title": "Time Scope Column"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "required_concepts",
                "expected_columns",
                "result_kind"
              ],
              "title": "QueryContract",
              "type": "object"
            }
          },
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "purpose": {
              "description": "这条 SQL 要验证的业务问题。",
              "maxLength": 300,
              "minLength": 1,
              "title": "Purpose",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "query_contract": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/QueryContract"
            },
            "sql": {
              "description": "待校验的 PostgreSQL SELECT 查询。",
              "maxLength": 8000,
              "minLength": 1,
              "title": "Sql",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "sql",
            "purpose",
            "query_contract"
          ],
          "title": "RunSqlArgs",
          "type": "object"
        }
      },
      "type": "function"
    },
    {
      "function": {
        "description": "确认用哪一条查询结果回答问题，结束查询。\n何时用：run_sql 返回了结果，并且你判断它能回答问题时。\n何时不用：结果不符合问题时，应修改查询。\n示例参数：{\"evidence_id\": \"E1\"}\n常见错误：证据编号不存在",
        "name": "submit_result",
        "parameters": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "evidence_id": {
              "description": "run_sql 返回的证据编号",
              "title": "Evidence Id",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "evidence_id"
          ],
          "title": "SubmitResultArgs",
          "type": "object"
        }
      },
      "type": "function"
    },
    {
      "function": {
        "description": "说明可用的表无法回答这个问题，结束查询。\n何时用：查看表结构后确认缺少所需数据时。\n何时不用：只是一次查询失败时，应先根据错误原因修改。\n示例参数：{\"reason\": \"没有记录客户满意度的表\", \"missing\": [\"客户满意度\"]}\n常见错误：没有查看表结构就下结论",
        "name": "report_insufficient",
        "parameters": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "missing": {
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "maxItems": 10,
              "title": "Missing",
              "type": "array"
            },
            "reason": {
              "maxLength": 300,
              "minLength": 1,
              "title": "Reason",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "reason"
          ],
          "title": "ReportInsufficientArgs",
          "type": "object"
        }
      },
      "type": "function"
    }
  ],
  "knowledge": [
    {
      "function": {
        "description": "用另一组关键词再检索一次公司文档。范围和有效期由系统决定。\n何时用：已有资料不足以回答，而且换一种说法可能找到时。\n何时不用：已有资料够回答时；不要重复相同的关键词。\n示例参数：{\"query\": \"退货 审批 流程\"}\n常见错误：把整段问题原样再搜一次",
        "name": "search_documents",
        "parameters": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "query": {
              "description": "要检索的中文关键词",
              "maxLength": 300,
              "minLength": 1,
              "title": "Query",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "query"
          ],
          "title": "SearchDocumentsArgs",
          "type": "object"
        }
      },
      "type": "function"
    },
    {
      "function": {
        "description": "提交基于资料的回答和它引用的 chunk_id，结束检索。\n何时用：资料能支持回答时。\n何时不用：资料不足时，不要凭常识作答。\n示例参数：{\"answer\": \"退货需要主管审批。\", \"citations\": [{\"chunk_id\": 123}]}\n常见错误：引用了没有出现过的 chunk_id",
        "name": "submit_answer",
        "parameters": {
          "$defs": {
            "AnalysisCitation": {
              "properties": {
                "chunk_id": {
                  "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
                  "title": "Chunk Id",
                  "type": "integer"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "chunk_id"
              ],
              "title": "AnalysisCitation",
              "type": "object"
            }
          },
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "answer": {
              "description": "只基于资料的回答",
              "minLength": 1,
              "title": "Answer",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "citations": {
              "description": "支撑答案的 chunk_id",
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/AnalysisCitation"
              },
              "minItems": 1,
              "title": "Citations",
              "type": "array"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "answer",
            "citations"
          ],
          "title": "SubmitAnswerArgs",
          "type": "object"
        }
      },
      "type": "function"
    },
    {
      "function": {
        "description": "说明文档里找不到答案，结束检索。\n何时用：换过关键词后资料仍然不足时。\n何时不用：资料已能回答问题的一部分时，应回答这一部分。\n示例参数：{\"reason\": \"文档没有提到库存周转天数\"}\n常见错误：",
        "name": "report_no_evidence",
        "parameters": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "reason": {
              "maxLength": 300,
              "minLength": 1,
              "title": "Reason",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "reason"
          ],
          "title": "ReportNoEvidenceArgs",
          "type": "object"
        }
      },
      "type": "function"
    }
  ],
  "versions": {
    "data": [
      "describe_table/v1",
      "run_sql/v1",
      "submit_result/v1",
      "report_insufficient/v1"
    ],
    "knowledge": [
      "search_documents/v1",
      "submit_answer/v1",
      "report_no_evidence/v1"
    ]
  }
}
